  "id": "mimir-loi",
  "name": "Mimir Labs — Letter of Intent",
  "formNumber": "ML-LOI",
  "description": "Non-binding letter of intent covering one or more Mimir Labs offerings (Yggdrasil, Ratatosk, Ragnarok, Bifrost, Norn, or Pilot Track). Records the proposed engagement, estimated Yggdrasil Footprint Score, and binding confidentiality/exclusivity/expense/governing-law sections. Source-of-truth markdown: docs/legal/LETTER_OF_INTENT.md.",
  "version": "1.0",
  "sourceType": "composed",
  "createdAt": "2026-04-30T00:00:00",
  "updatedAt": "2026-04-30T00:00:00",
  "author": "Mimir Labs LLC",
  "pageCount": 1,
  "body": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;\">MIMIR LABS — LETTER OF INTENT</h1><p><b>LOI No.:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[LOI Number]</span></p><p><b>Effective Date:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Effective Date]</span></p><p><b>BETWEEN:</b> Mimir Labs LLC (Harrisburg, Pennsylvania) (\"Provider\")</p><p><b>AND:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Prospective Client Entity]</span> (\"Prospective Client\")</p><h2>Purpose</h2><p>This LOI sets forth the preliminary understanding regarding a potential commercial engagement covering one or more Mimir Labs offerings (Yggdrasil ERP, Ratatosk, Ragnarok, Bifrost, Norn, or 120-Day Pilot Track). Non-binding except where stated.</p><h2>1. Proposed Engagement Scope</h2><p><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Engagement Scope]</span></p><h2>2. Estimated Yggdrasil Footprint (if applicable)</h2><p>Sites: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Sites]</span> · Entities: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Entities]</span> · Integrations: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Integrations]</span></p><p>Annual Transitions: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Transitions Tier]</span> · Compliance Posture: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Compliance]</span> · SLA Tier: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[SLA]</span> · Retention: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Retention]</span></p><p><b>Estimated Footprint Score:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Footprint Score]</span> · <b>Estimated Annual License:</b> $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Annual License]</span></p><p>Per published formula: Annual License = $30,000 + ($10,000 × Footprint Score). Estimates non-binding.</p><h2>3. Estimated Activation and Other Fees</h2><p>Activation: $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Activation]</span> · Ratatosk: $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Ratatosk Fee]</span> · Ragnarok: $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Ragnarok Fee]</span> · Audit Authority (annual): $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Audit Authority Fee]</span></p><p>Ratatosk and Ragnarok fees paid prior credit 1:1 against Yggdrasil activation.</p><h2>4. Timeline</h2><p>Definitive agreement(s) targeted for execution within <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Negotiation Window]</span> days.</p><h2>5. Non-Binding Nature</h2><p>Except for Sections 7 (Confidentiality), 8 (Exclusivity), 9 (Expenses), and 10 (Governing Law), this LOI is non-binding. Either Party may terminate negotiations at any time without liability.</p><h2>6. Pricing Representations</h2><p>Provider represents that pricing references reflect the published Yggdrasil pricing formula in effect as of the Effective Date. Adjustments before definitive execution will be communicated in writing; Prospective Client may terminate negotiations without obligation.</p><h2>7. Confidentiality (Binding)</h2><p>Each Party shall protect the other Party's confidential information, use it solely for evaluating the contemplated transaction, and not disclose it to third parties except as needed. Survives 3 years.</p><h2>8. Exclusivity (Binding; Optional)</h2><p>Exclusivity period (if elected): <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Exclusivity Days]</span> days.</p><h2>9. Expenses (Binding)</h2><p>Each Party bears its own costs and expenses in connection with negotiation and preparation of this LOI and definitive agreements.</p><h2>10. Governing Law (Binding)</h2><p>Governed by the laws of the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania.</p><h2>Signatures</h2><table style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>PROVIDER — Mimir Labs LLC</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>PROSPECTIVE CLIENT</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td></tr></table>",
